flowchart TD
    subgraph HostPlatform["Edge Robotics Hardware"]
        CPU["Host CPU (x86_64 or aarch64 ARM64)"]
        RAM["System RAM (4GB - 64GB)"]
        NPU_GPU["Optional NPU / GPU Acceleration (OpenVINO / TensorRT)"]
        Flash["Encrypted NVMe / eMMC Flash Storage"]
    end

    subgraph OSLayer["Embedded Linux OS Layer"]
        Systemd["systemd (Process Supervision & Watchdogs)"]
        Cgroups["cgroups v2 (memory.max, cpu.max limits)"]
        Tmpfs["tmpfs RAM-backed /dev/shm (Ring Buffers)"]
        LUKS["dm-crypt LUKS Volume Encryption"]
    end

    subgraph EonService["EON Edge Runtime Services"]
        CoreDaemon["eond (EON Core Daemon, user: eon)"]
        ModelSandbox["Inference Worker Pool (ONNX INT8 / FP16)"]
        SQLiteDB["context.db (Per-Subject AES-256 Encrypted)"]
    end

    CPU --> Cgroups
    RAM --> Tmpfs
    Flash --> LUKS

    Systemd -->|Watchdog 2.0s| CoreDaemon
    Cgroups -->|Restricts RAM/CPU| CoreDaemon
    Tmpfs <-->|Zero-Copy Frames| CoreDaemon
    LUKS <-->|Protected DB Storage| SQLiteDB

    CoreDaemon <--> ModelSandbox
    ModelSandbox -.-> NPU_GPU
